iba, o EOS Barigui está próximo ao Parque Barigui, com fácil acesso a restaurantes, serviços, escolas, comércio e às principais vias da cidade.\n\nUm apartamento que reúne metragem, privacidade, tecnologia e uma estrutura completa de lazer em uma localização privilegiada.","fotos":["https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6aba9de9e5dfadca6f17f398/pilar-homes-images-watermark/18d2441d-1d24-4fc3-8ff0-579567f8545f.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6aba9de9e5dfadca6f17f398/pilar-homes-images-watermark/43195c92-a45b-4d12-9860-06be9a1b6c6a.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6aba9de9e5dfadca6f17f398/pilar-homes-images-watermark/87aa8bdd-6919-4db4-91f0-dcbaf4842565.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6aba9de9e5dfadca6f17f398/pilar-homes-images-watermark/9c953144-63fb-49d2-95bc-179644bbd951.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6aba9de9e5dfadca6f17f398/pilar-homes-images-watermark/d1d575ea-859c-446f-b03f-5892ea8746cc.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6aba9de9e5dfadca6f17f398/pilar-homes-images-watermark/b7bfc461-fffd-40fe-af66-e11272328ab4.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6aba9de9e5dfadca6f17f398/pilar-homes-images-watermark/825b39c0-0d8b-4113-b125-b284200c986a.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6aba9de9e5dfadca6f17f398/pilar-homes-images-watermark/3a145fa6-f6e7-4321-94aa-3ee28291662a.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6aba9de9e5dfadca6f17f398/pilar-homes-images-watermark/38572cb4-df7b-4db6-bdd4-001400d3495a.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6aba9de9e5dfadca6f17f398/pilar-homes-images-watermark/f340d51c-2f40-4d25-b6fb-76602d25a0b8.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6aba9de9e5dfadca6f17f398/pilar-homes-images-watermark/c89f0e28-d89f-4de4-946c-dbf76410f983.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6aba9de9e5dfadca6f17f398/p